{{!-- Ideatrium mark (FD-139), the [i] alone, drawn from the #ideatrium-mark symbol; colours as in
icons/logo. The viewBox holds its own clear space: at the default 36 px box the mark itself is
24 px tall, as tall as the header logo. Decorative. --}}
<svg class="logo logo-mark{{#if class}} {{class}}{{/if}}" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="{{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}36{{/if}}" height="{{#if size}}{{size}}{{else}}36{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ideatrium-mark" /></svg>
